-- ==========================================================================
-- 88 Speedmart - Task 3 : Data Records  --  VERSION 2
-- Primary keys are generated INLINE by SEQUENCES in every INSERT, e.g.
--   'C' || LPAD(seq_customer.NEXTVAL, 4, '0')  ->  C0001, C0002, ...
-- Derived values are CALCULATED by triggers (never inserted manually):
--   OrderDetails.UnitPrice/Subtotal, Orders.TotalAmount, Payment.Amount,
--   ReturnDetails.RefundAmount, Returns.TotalRefundAmount,
--   PointTransaction.Point (Earn), Member.PointsBalance
-- ==========================================================================
